# Email sent to the reviewer who ran a Batch Publish, summarizing the outcome.
#
# Parameters:
#   {DEPOSIT_LOCATION}: The name of the deposit location the batch was published to.
#   {TOTAL_COUNT}: The number of submissions attempted.
#   {DEPOSITED_COUNT}: The number of submissions successfully deposited.
#   {FAILED_COUNT}: The number of submissions that failed to deposit.
#   {FINISHED_AT}: The date, time, and time zone at which the batch finished.
#   {DEPOSITED_LIST}: One line per deposited submission (id and title).
#   {FAILED_LIST}: One line per failed submission (id, title, and reason).
#
Subject: Batch Publish Summary: {DEPOSITED_COUNT} deposited, {FAILED_COUNT} failed

Batch publish to {DEPOSIT_LOCATION} finished at {FINISHED_AT}.

Attempted: {TOTAL_COUNT}
Deposited: {DEPOSITED_COUNT}
Failed: {FAILED_COUNT}

Failed deposits:
{FAILED_LIST}

Deposited submissions:
{DEPOSITED_LIST}

The Vireo Team
